        "section_path": "abstract/1",
        "section_heading": "METHODS",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "text": "A systematic search was conducted across seven databases - CINAHL, Embase, PubMed, PsycINFO, Web of Science, Cochrane Library, and Medline-OVID. Eligible studies included randomised controlled trials (RCTs) examining the effects of VRET on anxiety-related outcomes. Data were pooled using a random-effects model with Comprehensive Meta-Analysis (version 3.0; Biostat, Englewood, NJ, USA). Effect size were calculated using Hedges' g, and moderator analyses explored potential factors influencing the effect sizes.",
        "text_hash": "8d09e9a7f26e0e5b379a6e7a780ff533424dbc252be4cc16d50d21cd0f91f90a",
        "published_at": "2026-03-27T00:00:00Z",
